5,1,1,talk,Mio,,"I’m excited to start planning! I want to make sure the costs are fair for everyone, so I’ll look into the transport receipts and the whole-building let terms.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I’m curious about how we can all get along better. I’ll check what the seniors say about mixing and look at the attendance sheets from past trips.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I need to know if the workload is sustainable. I’ll check the canteen closure details and the vacation timetable for our own hall.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know if we can actually sleep and train well! I’ll check the accounts from the inland clubs and the prefecture rate sheet for beds.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I need to see where the money actually went. I’ll check the group transport receipts and the accounts from the two clubs that went inland.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"I’m glad we’re all on the same page! @Ryuji, do you think the hall timetable will be too tight for us?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, I hope the hall works out. @Ryuji, please tell us if the schedule is too demanding for everyone.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, the timetable is already crowded. A continuous block would force us into early mornings and late evenings, splitting our training.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Ryuji, that sounds exhausting! I hope we don't have to wake up super early. I really want to sleep well so I can train hard!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Ryuji, splitting the schedule increases transport costs. I need to see the actual figures before we commit to anything.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, I agree! Transport is a huge part of the budget. I’m worried about how we split those costs fairly if we go far.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, I understand your worry. But I am more concerned about who actually shows up. If people are too tired, they may not come at all.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shizue, fatigue is a factor, but the real issue is the labor. If we stay local, we cook and manage the hall ourselves. That is unsustainable.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Ryuji, cooking is hard! But I worry about sleeping in tiny rooms. I hope we find a place where we can rest properly!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Rin, sleep is vital, but the budget gap is too. I need to verify the inland costs before we decide.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,"@Rin, I hope the beds are comfy! @Shizue, I really want us all to have a great time together.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, I agree. A good time means everyone feels included. I hope the seniors’ advice helps us bridge the gaps between year groups.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"@Rin, sleep is a variable, not a luxury. If the facility enforces lights out, we train harder in the day. I will verify the labor costs.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Rin,,"@Ryuji, lights out at eleven? That sounds strict! I hope the beds are soft so I can sleep fast. I really want to be ready for training!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Misaki,,"@Rin, I understand. I will confirm the exact figures from the inland accounts to ensure we are not repeating last year’s financial mistake.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
