35,2,1,talk,Mio,,"I found the transport receipts! Going far costs 38% of the budget, staying local only 9%. Also, whole-building lets have non-refundable deposits.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"The seniors say mixing only happens in the evenings, and only when we sleep together. The attendance sheets show a fifth never came, and most left by winter.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The canteen is closed, so we cook ourselves. That cost two hours daily last year. The hall timetable is packed with three other clubs, forcing split sessions.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,"Eight people per room! And lights out at eleven? That sounds awful! But the beds are only 1,100 yen a night, which is cheap!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Misaki,,The inland accounts confirm eight to a room and strict lights out. Transport is 38% of the budget if we go far. I need to see the full breakdown.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, that 38% figure is scary! And if someone cancels late, we all pay their deposit. That feels really unfair to the rest of us.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, I understand the worry about deposits. But the attendance sheets show a fifth never came, and most left by winter. We need to keep everyone together.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, the deposit risk is real, but the labor cost is worse. Cooking two hours daily is unsustainable. We need staffed kitchens.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Ryuji, I agree! No more cooking! But eight people in one room? I might not fit! I need to know if we can sleep properly!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Rin, eight to a room explains the poor sleep. I need to verify if the 38% transport cost applies to the coastal option too.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, I hear you on the cooking. But if we book a whole building, the non-refundable deposit means we all pay for anyone who drops out late. That feels really unfair.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, I understand your worry about the deposit. But the seniors say mixing only happens when we sleep together. If we stay apart, we lose the connection.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shizue, sleeping together is necessary for cohesion, but the hall timetable makes a continuous block impossible. We would be split between early mornings and late evenings.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Ryuji, split sessions sound tiring! But if we sleep together, maybe we can all mix better? I want to be ready for training!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Ryuji, the hall split is a logistical failure. I need to know if the coastal option avoids the 38% transport penalty before I can support it.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, I hope the coastal option is cheaper! But I’m still worried about who pays if someone cancels. We need a fair rule for that.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, I understand your worry. But the seniors say mixing only happens when we sleep together. If we stay apart, we lose the connection.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"@Misaki, the coastal option is two prefectures away. Transport will still be a major line item. I need to see the exact figures to confirm it is not a repeat of last year’s deficit.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Rin,,"@Ryuji, two prefectures away sounds far! Will the beds be comfy? I really want to sleep well so I can train hard!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"@Ryuji, the inland accounts show the deficit came from transport and poor lodging. I need the coastal transport figures to ensure we do not repeat that mistake.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
